---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Growvidence — Evidence-Based Skill Tracker"
  description="Turn learning activity into demonstrable capability. Track practice, independent work and reviewable evidence in one learner-owned workflow."
>
  <section class="hero">
    <p class="eyebrow">A clearer way to measure learning</p>
    <h1>
      Don't just learn.
      <br />
      <span>Prove your progress.</span>
    </h1>
    <p class="intro">
      Growvidence is being built around a simple idea: completing a task is
      activity. Demonstrating a skill requires evidence.
    </p>
    <a class="primary-link" href="#how-it-works">
      Explore the approach
    </a>
    <p class="status">
      Early foundation · Application features are not available yet
    </p>
  </section>

  <section id="how-it-works" class="content-section">
    <p class="eyebrow">The evidence trail</p>
    <h2>From learning activity to demonstrated capability</h2>
    <ol class="steps">
      <li>
        <strong>Learn</strong>
        <span>Record the concept or skill you are exploring.</span>
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Practice</strong>
        <span>Describe what you attempted and what you understood.</span>
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Create</strong>
        <span>Link a project, artifact, test result or other work.</span>
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Demonstrate</strong>
        <span>
          Show what you can do independently and explain your choices.
        </span>
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Review</strong>
        <span>
          Use feedback and explicit criteria to identify what remains to learn.
        </span>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </section>

  <section id="principles" class="content-section principles">
    <p class="eyebrow">Product principles</p>
    <h2>Progress should be honest and portable</h2>
    <div class="principle-grid">
      <article>
        <h3>Evidence over activity</h3>
        <p>A completed checkbox or streak does not establish mastery.</p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <h3>AI use is transparent</h3>
        <p>
          AI-assisted work and independent performance are recorded distinctly.
        </p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <h3>Learner-owned data</h3>
        <p>
          The planned MVP is local-first, with exportable records and no
          required account.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .hero,
  .content-section {
    max-width: 1040px;
    margin: auto;
    padding: 5rem 1.5rem;
  }
  .hero {
    padding-top: 7rem;
    padding-bottom: 6rem;
  }
  .eyebrow {
    color: #a43618;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.13em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  h1 {
    max-width: 850px;
    margin: 0.5rem 0 1.25rem;
    font-size: clamp(3rem, 8vw, 6.5rem);
    line-height: 0.99;
    letter-spacing: -0.065em;
  }
  h1 span {
    color: #c8431f;
  }
  .intro {
    max-width: 650px;
    font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 2vw, 1.35rem);
    color: #514d46;
  }
  .primary-link {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    padding: 0.85rem 1.2rem;
    border-radius: 0.55rem;
    background: #1c1b19;
    color: white;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .primary-link:focus-visible {
    outline: 3px solid #c8431f;
    outline-offset: 4px;
  }
  .status {
    margin-top: 1.25rem;
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    color: #625d54;
  }
  .content-section {
    border-top: 1px solid #c8c1b4;
  }
  h2 {
    max-width: 700px;
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.5rem);
    line-height: 1.08;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
  }
  .steps {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(170px, 1fr));
    gap: 1rem;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
    counter-reset: trail;
  }
  .steps li,
  .principle-grid article {
    padding: 1.25rem;
    border: 1px solid #c8c1b4;
    border-radius: 0.8rem;
  }
  .steps li {
    counter-increment: trail;
  }
  .steps li::before {
    content: "0" counter(trail);
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    color: #a43618;
    font-weight: 800;
  }
  .steps strong,
  .steps span {
    display: block;
  }
  .steps span,
  .principle-grid p {
    color: #514d46;
  }
  .principle-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
    gap: 1rem;
  }
  h3 {
    margin-top: 0;
  }
  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
    .eyebrow,
    h1 span,
    .steps li::before {
      color: #ff987c;
    }
    .intro,
    .status,
    .steps span,
    .principle-grid p {
      color: #c5bfb3;
    }
    .content-section,
    .steps li,
    .principle-grid article {
      border-color: #4a4842;
    }
    .primary-link {
      background: #f2eee3;
      color: #1c1b19;
    }
  }
</style>
